{"articleNo":"162425","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=162425&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"제4회 G-Star 대학생 창업경진대회 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.11.29","hit":"2228","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">안녕하세요 창업교육센터입니다.</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">\"제4회 G-Star 대학생 창업경진대회\" 안내를 드리려고 합니다.</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">본관 강당에서 진행되며, 많은 경품과 응원상, 초청공연 등이 준비되어 있다고 하니 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. 대회명 : <strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">제4회 G-Star 대학생 창업경진대회</span></strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 주최 : 경북창조경제혁신센터</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 후원 : 미래창조과학부, 경상북도, 구미시, 삼성전자</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. 일시 : <strong><u>11. 30.(수), 13:00~18:00</u></strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">5. 장소 : <strong>금오공과대학교 본관 대강당</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">6. <strong>레크레이션 경품 및 이벤트경품(삼성 기어서클, 삼성기어 S3 등)</strong> 제공 예정</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">7. 각 대학별로 경진대회 중 적극참여하는 대학에게 <strong>응원상(문화상품권)</strong> 제공 예정</font></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\">8. 진행일정</font></p></span><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 69.49pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND: #e6ecf3; HEIGHT: 18.63pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">구 분</font></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 92.17pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND: #e6ecf3; HEIGHT: 18.63pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">시 간</font></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 147.72pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; BACKGROUND: #e6ecf3; HEIGHT: 18.63pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">내 용</font></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.2